{"ID":"20251104160356-cybl69x","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20251104160356-cybl69x","title":"UPL9-2——降低几何复杂度","type":"doc","updated":"20251104172945"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251104160356-39w24ru","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20251104160356-39w24ru","updated":"20251104161410"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"为什么要降低几何复杂度"}]},{"ID":"20251104160447-vmon0hd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251104160447-vmon0hd","updated":"20251104160451"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"降低几何复杂度的主要目的是"}]},{"ID":"20251104160451-3votmfq","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Typ":1},"Properties":{"id":"20251104160451-3votmfq","updated":"20251104160451"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251104160451-rburx1a","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"MS4=","Num":1},"Properties":{"id":"20251104160451-rburx1a","updated":"20251104160451"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251104160451-rtvpxfo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251104160451-rtvpxfo","updated":"20251104160451"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"减轻 GPU 与 CPU 在几何处理阶段的负担"}]}]},{"ID":"20251104160451-e3m4mau","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Mi4=","Num":2},"Properties":{"id":"20251104160451-e3m4mau","updated":"20251104160451"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251104160451-wz85gtr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251104160451-wz85gtr","updated":"20251104160451"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"减轻 内存带宽 压力和 显存 压力"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20251104160450-ldua44w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251104160450-ldua44w","updated":"20251104160450"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"等等"}]},{"ID":"20251104160504-q4sqgh5","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20251104160504-q4sqgh5","updated":"20251104161410"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251104160504-viluaa6","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20251104160504-viluaa6","updated":"20251104161410"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251104160447-9mqnk7o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251104160447-9mqnk7o","updated":"20251104160447"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"从GPU角度"}]},{"ID":"20251104160506-o164k3t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251104160506-o164k3t","updated":"20251104161410"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"GPU 渲染管线的第一步就是处理顶点，\n如果场景里有几百万甚至上千万个顶点，GPU 必须逐个变换（模型矩阵、光照计算、蒙皮等），\n负担会极大，可能带来："}]},{"ID":"20251104160538-mmsji4d","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Typ":1},"Properties":{"id":"20251104160538-mmsji4d","updated":"20251104160538"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251104160538-khkrad4","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"MS4=","Num":1},"Properties":{"id":"20251104160538-khkrad4","updated":"20251104160538"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251104160538-k0x6knx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251104160538-k0x6knx","updated":"20251104160538"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"帧率下降"}]}]},{"ID":"20251104160538-94gy0xn","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Mi4=","Num":2},"Properties":{"id":"20251104160538-94gy0xn","updated":"20251104160538"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251104160538-nq9p5aw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251104160538-nq9p5aw","updated":"20251104160538"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"移动端功耗升高、发热严重"}]}]},{"ID":"20251104160538-hlwtdv1","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"My4=","Num":3},"Properties":{"id":"20251104160538-hlwtdv1","updated":"20251104160538"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251104160538-sok9fns","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251104160538-sok9fns","updated":"20251104160538"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"顶点带宽不足导致 GPU 卡顿"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20251104160536-q42o7iq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251104160536-q42o7iq","updated":"20251104160536"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"等等"}]},{"ID":"20251104160535-a6wluip","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251104160535-a6wluip","updated":"20251104160535"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"因此，降低几何复杂度，相当于直接减少了顶点着色器的工作量"}]}]},{"ID":"20251104160504-3pyqthn","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20251104160504-3pyqthn","updated":"20251104160504"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251104160447-vr0q9pn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251104160447-vr0q9pn","updated":"20251104160544"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"从 CPU 角度"}]},{"ID":"20251104160541-99mla2w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251104160541-99mla2w","updated":"20251104160610"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"每个网格渲染之前，CPU 要把网格数据提交给 GPU（DrawCall），\n如果模型过于复杂（高面数、网格碎片多），则会导致 CPU 消耗在渲染准备工作上，挤占逻辑、物理计算上的时间\n因此，降低几何复杂度，可以间接减少 CPU 开销"}]}]},{"ID":"20251104160504-7v8s0aq","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20251104160504-7v8s0aq","updated":"20251104160504"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251104160447-wfxrbr5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251104160447-wfxrbr5","updated":"20251104160447"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"从显存角度"}]},{"ID":"20251104160614-x22lgdl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251104160614-x22lgdl","updated":"20251104160617"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"一般高面数模型文件更大，贴图需要更高分辨率支撑\n高分辨率贴图以及顶点数据都需要占显存，可能给显存带来压力\n因此，降低几何复杂度，可以减轻显存压力"}]}]},{"ID":"20251104160504-rhvs8lo","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20251104160504-rhvs8lo","updated":"20251104160622"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251104160447-2htqyg1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251104160447-2htqyg1","updated":"20251104160447"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"从内存带宽角度"}]},{"ID":"20251104160621-5kzh7dj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251104160621-5kzh7dj","updated":"20251104160622"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"每帧都需要把顶点、顶点索引相关数据传送到GPU，几何复杂度高会增加数据传输量，消耗内存带宽\n因此，降低几何复杂度，可以减少内存带宽的占用"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20251104160631-t205omg","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20251104160631-t205omg","updated":"20251104172945"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"降低几何复杂度的具体方法"}]},{"ID":"20251104160640-qnq25h9","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Typ":1},"Properties":{"id":"20251104160640-qnq25h9","updated":"20251104172945"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251104160642-fhl1558","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"MS4=","Num":1},"Properties":{"id":"20251104160642-fhl1558","updated":"20251104160642"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251104160642-b2oan9v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251104160642-b2oan9v","updated":"20251104160642"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"美术优化"}]},{"ID":"20251104160702-f7yckbd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251104160702-f7yckbd","updated":"20251104160726"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"从源头减少模型的复杂度，主要由美术人员在建模阶段直接控制，主要做法："}]},{"ID":"20251104160720-d2sweml","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Typ":1},"Properties":{"id":"20251104160720-d2sweml","updated":"20251104160720"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251104160720-jkijdff","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"MS4=","Num":1},"Properties":{"id":"20251104160720-jkijdff","updated":"20251104160720"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251104160720-bc93xn8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251104160720-bc93xn8","updated":"20251104160720"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"少用高面数模型，能用贴图法线（Normal Map）代替细节就用贴图"}]}]},{"ID":"20251104160720-ji9uxy0","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Mi4=","Num":2},"Properties":{"id":"20251104160720-ji9uxy0","updated":"20251104160720"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251104160720-ai5y0kq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251104160720-ai5y0kq","updated":"20251104160722"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"使用合理的多边形分布，把细分面留给容易注意到的部位"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20251104160722-nlspv4e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251104160722-nlspv4e","updated":"20251104160723"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"等等"}]},{"ID":"20251104160709-iybgzpm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251104160709-iybgzpm","updated":"20251104160709"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主要目的就是用最少的资源做出做好的美术表现\n从源头制定好的规范，可以让整体模型预算更加可控\n避免后期出现性能问题时再来改"}]}]},{"ID":"20251104160643-3rjyq35","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Mi4=","Num":2},"Properties":{"id":"20251104160643-3rjyq35","updated":"20251104160643"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251104160643-yd3r857","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251104160643-yd3r857","updated":"20251104160646"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"移除网格"}]},{"ID":"20251104160734-dvqu6ai","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251104160734-dvqu6ai","updated":"20251104160751"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"完全剔除不必要的几何体，避免 GPU 浪费处理不可见或者无关的网格"}]},{"ID":"20251104160748-99725ym","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251104160748-99725ym","updated":"20251104160748"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主要做法："}]},{"ID":"20251104160746-zurupl1","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Typ":1},"Properties":{"id":"20251104160746-zurupl1","updated":"20251104160746"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251104160746-1eibzkq","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"MS4=","Num":1},"Properties":{"id":"20251104160746-1eibzkq","updated":"20251104160746"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251104160746-irueb55","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251104160746-irueb55","updated":"20251104160746"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"删除关卡中看不到或不重要的装饰性几何体"}]}]},{"ID":"20251104160746-dlcsyvf","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Mi4=","Num":2},"Properties":{"id":"20251104160746-dlcsyvf","updated":"20251104160746"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251104160746-kscvs24","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251104160746-kscvs24","updated":"20251104160746"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用法线贴图、贴花效果代替体积结构，比如雕刻、螺丝、砖块接缝等效果等"}]}]},{"ID":"20251104160746-by4m4qb","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"My4=","Num":3},"Properties":{"id":"20251104160746-by4m4qb","updated":"20251104160746"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251104160746-8v1i5y2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251104160746-8v1i5y2","updated":"20251104160746"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用平面贴图代替立体模型，比如窗户格子效果等"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20251104160740-15k5hvn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251104160740-15k5hvn","updated":"20251104160742"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主要目的就是优化关卡中装饰或远景模型，有时候牺牲一些细微表现，带给玩家的体验区别不大"}]}]},{"ID":"20251104160647-raxnyu4","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"My4=","Num":3},"Properties":{"id":"20251104160647-raxnyu4","updated":"20251104160647"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251104160647-dwmo17x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251104160647-dwmo17x","updated":"20251104160650"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"LOD"}]},{"ID":"20251104160753-xtdi33q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251104160753-xtdi33q","updated":"20251104160808"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"利用 Unity 中的 LOD Group 组件，根据距离切换不同分辨率的模型网格\nLOD 模型通常由美术导出（也可以利用一些插件自己生成），配合摄像机视距控制显示哪一个模型"}]},{"ID":"20251104160810-2kxe1po","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251104160810-2kxe1po","updated":"20251104160817"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主要做法：\n让游戏中的角色、建筑、大型创景元素使用 LOD Group 组件关联不同精度的模型\n这样能显著减少远处对象的顶点数"}]},{"ID":"20251104161825-mgrhcib","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251104161825-mgrhcib","updated":"20251104161834"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"详细可见："},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"block-ref","TextMarkBlockRefID":"20251104161745-haxwvho","TextMarkBlockRefSubtype":"d","TextMarkTextContent":"UPL9-3——LOD"}]}]},{"ID":"20251104160650-elrqtfg","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"NC4=","Num":4},"Properties":{"id":"20251104160650-elrqtfg","updated":"20251104172945"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251104160650-jetziuw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251104160650-jetziuw","updated":"20251104160655"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"遮挡剔除"}]},{"ID":"20251104160818-pnuqcwv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251104160818-pnuqcwv","updated":"20251104160839"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"利用 Unity 中自带的遮挡剔除 (Occlusion Culling) 相关功能，\n避免渲染那些被其它物体完全挡住、相机不可见的物体，从而减少 GPU 和 CPU 的渲染开销"}]},{"ID":"20251104160841-n4y9dgm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251104160841-n4y9dgm","updated":"20251104160848"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主要做法：\n在一些容易产生遮挡的环境中，比如室内场景、复杂建筑场景、森林场景等\n使用 Unity 中的遮挡剔除功能，剔除在墙体、地形、树木等背后的对象，让他们不被渲染，减少渲染开销"}]},{"ID":"20251104172935-2figyg7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251104172935-2figyg7","updated":"20251104172945"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"详细可见："},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"block-ref","TextMarkBlockRefID":"20251104172753-5vtxovd","TextMarkBlockRefSubtype":"d","TextMarkTextContent":"UPL9-4——遮挡剔除"}]}]},{"ID":"20251104160655-ow1mlnp","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"NS4=","Num":5},"Properties":{"id":"20251104160655-ow1mlnp","updated":"20251104161306"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251104160655-34mw33v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251104160655-34mw33v","updated":"20251104160659"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"更多方式"}]},{"ID":"20251104160850-gkjz9k4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251104160850-gkjz9k4","updated":"20251104160904"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"以下这些方法，可能会影响美术表现效果"}]},{"ID":"20251104160905-fe2tpqh","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Typ":1},"Properties":{"id":"20251104160905-fe2tpqh","updated":"20251104161306"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251104160919-nosg045","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"MS4=","Num":1},"Properties":{"id":"20251104160919-nosg045","updated":"20251104160919"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251104160919-uchqdxp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251104160919-uchqdxp","updated":"20251104160919"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"简化骨骼动画"}]},{"ID":"20251104160920-n8vato7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251104160920-n8vato7","updated":"20251104160924"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"骨骼数量过多时，GPU 和 CPU 负担都重\n可以减少关节数，或者用 VAT（骨骼烘焙动画纹理）代替"}]}]},{"ID":"20251104160919-9cakd7b","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Mi4=","Num":2},"Properties":{"id":"20251104160919-9cakd7b","updated":"20251104160919"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251104160919-0ktdt7r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251104160919-0ktdt7r","updated":"20251104160937"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Impostor (冒充者/替身) 技术\n把一个复杂的 3D 物体 预先烘焙成 2D 纹理\n用 2D 贴图来冒充 3D 模型，可以配合 LOD 使用"}]},{"ID":"20251104160939-gvdb3ja","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20251104160939-gvdb3ja","updated":"20251104160941"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251104160941-hrxhe06","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20251104160941-hrxhe06","updated":"20251104160941"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251104160941-m9ex82d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251104160941-m9ex82d","updated":"20251104161802"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"近距离，使用正式的 3D 模型"}]}]},{"ID":"20251104160942-ybdn2pm","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20251104160942-ybdn2pm","updated":"20251104160942"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251104160942-lwul2y4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251104160942-lwul2y4","updated":"20251104161800"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"中远距离，使用低模 LOD"}]}]},{"ID":"20251104160943-6ryw40h","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20251104160943-6ryw40h","updated":"20251104160943"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251104160943-uetxzdc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251104160943-uetxzdc","updated":"20251104161805"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"超远距离，使用 Impostor (冒充者/替身) 技术"}]}]}]}]},{"ID":"20251104160919-nnoh4cl","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"My4=","Num":3},"Properties":{"id":"20251104160919-nnoh4cl","updated":"20251104161306"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251104160919-9rg5ed3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251104160919-9rg5ed3","updated":"20251104160919"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Mesh Simplification（网格简化算法）"}]},{"ID":"20251104160949-4oycf0r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251104160949-4oycf0r","updated":"20251104161000"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"美术在建模时，使用一些建模软件自带的网格简化功能，Unity 也有一些第三方插件，比如："}]},{"ID":"20251104161000-yu3ivsi","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20251104161000-yu3ivsi","updated":"20251104161306"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251104161000-rj4y341","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20251104161000-rj4y341","updated":"20251104161306"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251104161000-w2hd88h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251104161000-w2hd88h","updated":"20251104161306"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"RMS(Runtime Mesh Simplifier): "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"a","TextMarkAHref":"https://assetstore.unity.com/packages/tools/utilities/rms-extremely-fast-runtime-mesh-simplifier-for-mobile-desktop-160916","TextMarkTextContent":"RMS - Extremely Fast Runtime Mesh Simplifier for Mobile \u0026amp; Desktop | 实用工具 工具 | Unity Asset Store"}]}]},{"ID":"20251104161001-blvu9v9","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20251104161001-blvu9v9","updated":"20251104161251"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251104161001-lv5sj2f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251104161001-lv5sj2f","updated":"20251104161251"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Mesh Simplify: "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"a","TextMarkAHref":"https://assetstore.unity.com/packages/tools/modeling/mesh-simplify-43658","TextMarkTextContent":"Mesh Simplify | 建模 | Unity Asset Store"}]}]}]}]}]},{"ID":"20251104160857-jtwt9ig","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251104160857-jtwt9ig","updated":"20251104160903"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"等等"}]}]}]}]}